    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-raincourt_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「どうして、あなたが謝るの？　あなたは、ほんとうに……良い子。素直にひとを愛せる、良い子。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「人生を謳歌できる、ふつうの子。わたしとは、ちがう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「なのに。わたしは、そんなあなたを利用した！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/cry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「操って、つまらない目的のために、嘘をついて騙して！　傷つけてっ、酷いことをしたのに！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「わたしは、愛される資格のない悪い人間なのに！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「『生まれてこなければよかった』のに、ひとに迷惑をかけるだけなのに！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-fairy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-fairy_expression/cry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 32,
    "dress": "old-raincourt",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-raincourt_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「そんなこと、ないです。あたし、時国先輩のことまだよく知らないけど。だから、偉そうなこと言えませんけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「あたし、ほんとに……。時国先輩には、感謝しかしてませんよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 32,
    "dress": "old-raincourt",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-raincourt_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「あたし、ドジばっかりで、迷惑かけてばっかりで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「誰に相談しても、『何でそんなこともできないの？』みたいに、馬鹿にされるだけで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 32,
    "dress": "old-raincourt",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-raincourt_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「でも。時国先輩だけが、そんなあたしの話をちゃんと聞いてくれたんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 32,
    "dress": "old-raincourt",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-raincourt_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「あたし、あのころ……。何も、わかんなくなってて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「ほんとに、おかしいのは自分なんだ、自分のせいで失敗ばかりするんだって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「そう思いつめて諦めて、いつも俯いてましたよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 32,
    "dress": "old-raincourt",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-raincourt_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「だけど、時国先輩だけはそんなあたしを見放さなかった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 32,
    "dress": "old-raincourt",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-raincourt_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「寄り添って、話を聞いて、そばにいてくれた。転んでばかりで、迷惑かけてばかりの、あたしのそばに」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "きこ",
    "text": "「すごく、嬉しかったんです……。騙されてもいい、時国先輩が悪いひとでもよかった。」"
